  "Digital ": "Digital ",
  " Business Card ": " Tarjeta de visita ",
  " Builder": " Constructor",
  "vCard create a digital business card that helps you reach more customers": "vCard crea una tarjeta de presentación digital que te ayuda a llegar a más clientes",
  "Stop wasting money on Expensive Hard Copy Business Cards": "Deje de gastar dinero en costosas tarjetas de visita impresas",
  "A vCard is an electronic business or personal card and also the name of an industry specification for the kind of communication exchange that is done on business or personal cards. You may have seen a vCard attached to an email note someone has sent you.": "Una vCard es una tarjeta personal o comercial electrónica y también el nombre de una especificación de la industria para el tipo de intercambio de comunicación que se realiza en tarjetas personales o comerciales. ",
  "Self-manageable and intuitive": "Autogestionable e intuitivo",
  "vCard is fast, easy and intuitive! You only need a few steps to have your own virtual card. Manage your business` cards in seconds and modify any content with immediate application through an easy and intuitive platform.": "¡vCard es rápido, fácil e intuitivo! ",
  "Send and save contacts as vCards": "Enviar y guardar contactos como vCards",
  "VCF (Virtual Card Format) is a digital file format for storing contact information. The format is widely used for data interchange among popular information exchange applications. A VCF file usually contains information such as contact’s name, phone number, email. Being supported by email clients and services, there is no loss of data during the transfer of contacts via using the vCard format. The media type for VCF file format is text/vcard.": "VCF (formato de tarjeta virtual) es un formato de archivo digital para almacenar información de contacto. ",
  "Smarten your business cards.": "Mejora tus tarjetas de visita.",
  "Digital business cards also known as virtual business cards and e business cards are like the digital makeover that the paper cards have needed for a long time.": "Las tarjetas de presentación digitales, también conocidas como tarjetas de presentación virtuales y tarjetas de presentación electrónicas, son como el cambio de imagen digital que las tarjetas de papel han necesitado durante mucho tiempo.",
  "Choose what to share!": "¡Elige qué compartir!",
  "Our vcards are self-manageable, therefore, you’ll always be in control of the information you’re sharing. Centralize all your social media profiles and make your community grow.": "Nuestras vcards son autoadministrables, por lo tanto, siempre tendrás el control de la información que compartes. ",
  "The most cost-effective way to expand your reach": "La forma más rentable de ampliar su alcance",
  "Customize your digital business card to match your brand.Choose from 21 beautiful themes with it`s unique colors.Add,modify update your business information quickly and easily": "Personalice su tarjeta de presentación digital para que coincida con su marca. Elija entre 21 hermosos temas con sus colores únicos. Agregue, modifique y actualice la información de su empresa de forma rápida y sencilla.",
